        "original_id": "70aee69e-bfb3-5cf1-8ea0-56f5d2d58218",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Vincent Sherman, David Seltzer\n- Roles: film director, screenwriter, producer\n- Films: Mr. Skeffington, Nora Prentiss, The Young Philadelphians, The Omen, Bird on a Wire, Lucas, Punchline, Shining Through\n\nFacts:\n- Vincent Sherman directed the films \"Mr. Skeffington\" in 1944, \"Nora Prentiss\" in 1947, and \"The Young Philadelphians\" in 1959.\n- David Seltzer was born in 1940 and is an American screenwriter, producer, and director.\n- David Seltzer wrote the screenplay for \"The Omen\" in 1976.\n- David Seltzer wrote and directed the 1986 teen tragicomedy \"Lucas,\" which starred Corey Haim, Charlie Sheen, and Winona Ryder.\n- David Seltzer wrote and directed the 1988 comedy \"Punchline,\" which starred Sally Field and Tom Hanks.\n- David Seltzer wrote the screenplay for \"Bird on a Wire\" in 1990.\n- David Seltzer wrote and directed the 1992 film \"Shining Through,\" which starred Melanie Griffith and Michael Douglas.",
        "type": "TextSummary"
      },
      {
        "id": 1,
        "original_id": "009d5b22-3795-5ccd-89b0-92688c02726f",
